# Chatman Ecosystem — GitHub Cloud Operating Doctrine

GENERATED by `ggen sync` from `github-cloud-operating-doctrine-pack/ontology.ttl`.

> GitHub is an authenticated remote object and execution graph, not a CLI-first workstation. A failed transport is a failed edge. A failed principal is a failed authority route. Neither is a failed task while another lawful path to the requested consequence remains.

## Governing optimization

```text
maximum verified consequence
────────────────────────────
   cycle time × WIP × risk
```

