## Authority domains

These principals are distinct; authority never transfers by implication.

{% for row in principals %}- `{{ row.slug }}` — {{ row.label }}
{% endfor %}

In particular:

```text
ChatGPT connector can read repository B
≠
Actions GITHUB_TOKEN can read repository B
```

A default Actions-token clone failure establishes `DEFAULT_ACTIONS_GITHUB_TOKEN_ROUTE_FAILED`, not `BLOCKED`.

