## Canonical implementation loop

```text
OBSERVE REPO
  ↓
ADMIT EXACT SHA
  ↓
MATERIALIZE ONLY WHAT IS REQUIRED
  ↓
IMPLEMENT
  ↓
VERIFY
  ↓
CONNECTOR PUBLISH
  ↓
DRAFT PR
  ↓
REOBSERVE EXACT HEAD
  ↓
ACTIONS → JOBS → LOGS
  ↓
ARTIFACTS
  ↓
LOCAL REPLAY
  ↓
RECEIPT
```

For CI repair, loop from the exact PR head through checks/jobs/logs to the first causal failure, classify diff relevance, repair narrowly, publish, and reobserve the new exact head until the requested boundary is established.

## Mutation receipt

Every GitHub mutation records:

- operation;
- repository;
- previous identity;
- new identity;
- authority/principal;
- observed consequence.

Branch/ref mutation is non-force by default and must be reobserved after publication.

## Clean-session invariant

Never manufacture a blocker because the cloud environment does not resemble a developer laptop. Dynamic connector capability discovery outranks stale assumptions about `git`, `gh`, direct network, secrets, or Actions authority.
